"Glow Free AI needs no sign-in (shared, about one reply every 30 s); a free Puter sign-in or your own API key gives faster models.": "Glow Free AI 无需登录（共享，大约每 30 秒一条回复）；免费登录 Puter 或使用你自己的 API 密钥可获得更快的模型。",
