"Glow Hands for an always-on Linux box: see the setup guide": "在常开的 Linux 主机上运行 Glow Hands：请参阅安装指南",
"Glow Hands is a small program on your PC that lets GlowLead open sites, click, type and fill forms in its own browser window. You can watch and take over at any time.": "Glow Hands 是你电脑上的一个小程序，让 GlowLead 能在独立的浏览器窗口中打开网站、点击、输入和填写表单。你可以随时观看并接管。",
"Glow Hands isn't packaged for Mac yet; use the instant cloud browser or link a Windows/Linux PC.": "Glow Hands 暂未提供 Mac 版；请使用即时云浏览器或连接 Windows/Linux 电脑。",
"Glow Hands runs on your PC at 127.0.0.1 (ports 8765–8770) and pairs with GlowLead using a token; nothing goes through the internet.": "Glow Hands 在你的电脑上运行于 127.0.0.1（端口 8765–8770），通过令牌与 GlowLead 配对，不经过互联网。",
