"Glow Offline: download a small AI model once (from 0.3 GB) in GlowChat → Settings → Offline AI on this device, and GlowChat keeps answering with no internet. It runs on your device's graphics chip and nothing you type leaves the device.": "Glow Offline：在 GlowChat → 设置 → 本设备上的离线 AI 中下载一次小型 AI 模型（0.3 GB 起），GlowChat 就能在没有网络时继续回答。它在你设备的显卡芯片上运行，你输入的内容不会离开设备。",
