"Writing": "写作",
"Yes, for free: open Glow in Safari, tap Share, then Add to Home Screen. It opens full screen like any app, works offline and keeps its own storage. Glow isn't in the App Store, because Apple charges developers 99 US dollars a year to list apps there.": "有，而且免费：在 Safari 中打开 Glow，点按“共享”，再选择“添加到主屏幕”。它像普通应用一样全屏打开，可离线使用，并拥有独立存储。Glow 没有上架 App Store，因为 Apple 向开发者收取每年 99 美元的上架费用。",
"Yes. Every Glow app opens without internet once you have visited it, and your chats stay on your device. Download Glow Offline in GlowChat (Settings → Offline AI on this device) and GlowChat keeps answering with AI that runs on your device's graphics chip. Web research, the AI crew and cloud models need internet.": "可以。每个 Glow 应用只要访问过一次就能在没有网络时打开，你的聊天记录保留在你的设备上。在 GlowChat 中下载 Glow Offline（设置 → 本设备上的离线 AI），GlowChat 就能用在你设备显卡芯片上运行的 AI 继续回答。网页调研、AI 团队和云端模型仍需联网。",
"Yes. Glow, GlowChat, GlowRoom and GlowLead are free with no sign-up. A free Puter sign-in unlocks faster AI models, and the optional Glow Pro plan only raises limits for big missions.": "是的。Glow、GlowChat、GlowRoom 和 GlowLead 均免费，无需注册。免费登录 Puter 可解锁更快的 AI 模型，可选的 Glow Pro 套餐只会提高大型任务的额度上限。",
"You": "你",
"You get a new AI tool at work. What do you do first?": "公司给你一个新的 AI 工具，你会先做什么？",
"You give a goal to GlowLead. GlowLead delegates writing to GlowChat, research and code to the GlowRoom crew, and website steps to browser control. Browser control is Glow Hands on a PC, the Glow Android app's own browser, or the instant cloud browser. All apps share one Glow account and storage in your browser, and use Glow AI.": "你把目标交给 GlowLead。GlowLead 把写作交给 GlowChat，把调研和代码交给 GlowRoom 团队，把网站操作交给浏览器控制。浏览器控制可以是电脑上的 Glow Hands、Glow Android 应用自带的浏览器，或即时云浏览器。所有应用共享浏览器中的同一个 Glow 账户和存储，并使用 Glow AI。",
